      "message": "From the man pages we should see EAGAIN when the timeout has happened: https://man7.org/linux/man-pages/man2/sigwaitinfo.2.html. Since we don\u0027t pass a timer I think we should not get this error. Though I am allowing this because sigwait64 uses sigwaitinfo64 (in bionic) and that allows EAGAIN, so I did the same to match the behaviour: https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:bionic/libc/bionic/signal.cpp;l\u003d290?q\u003dsigwait64\u0026ss\u003dandroid%2Fplatform%2Fsuperproject%2Fmain",
